IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `mlr-core`
IMPORT `mlr1-reg08-09-application`

-- TESTS for regulations 8 and 9.  Every expected value is written from the text of the regulation (the
-- line named in the comment), not from what the module computes.

§ `reg 8(2): the kinds listed`
-- src:240-250: (a) credit institutions ... (k) custodian wallet providers; the auction platform is not on the list.
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `credit institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `financial institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `auditor` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `insolvency practitioner` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `external accountant` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `tax adviser` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `independent legal professional` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `trust or company service provider` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `estate agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `letting agent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `high value dealer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `casino` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `art market participant` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `cryptoasset exchange provider` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `custodian wallet provider` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(2) the kind of person is one of those listed in this paragraph` `auction platform` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `reg 8(1)(a) and (b)`
-- src:237: (a) are listed in paragraph (2); a person with several kinds is listed if one is.
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(a) the person is listed in paragraph (2)` (LIST `casino`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(a) the person is listed in paragraph (2)` (LIST `auction platform`, `estate agent`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(a) the person is listed in paragraph (2)` (LIST `auction platform`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(a) the person is listed in paragraph (2)` EMPTY EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- src:238: (b) do not come within the exclusions set out in regulation 15.
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(b) the person does not come within the exclusions set out in regulation 15` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(b) the person does not come within the exclusions set out in regulation 15` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 8(1)(b) the person does not come within the exclusions set out in regulation 15` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `reg 8(1): who is a relevant person`
-- src:236: persons acting in the course of business carried on by them in the United Kingdom, who are listed and not excluded.
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `credit institution`) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `high value dealer`, `trust or company service provider`) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not carrying on business in the United Kingdom
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `credit institution`) FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- listed in no way (an auction platform alone is not within paragraph (2))
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `auction platform`) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` EMPTY TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- within the exclusions of regulation 15
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `high value dealer`) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- regulation 15 has not answered: nothing is decided
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `casino`) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- a definite no stays a no whatever regulation 15 says
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` EMPTY TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 8 the person is a relevant person` (LIST `casino`) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE

